WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.194
The Birch and Swinnerton-Dyer formula.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.950
It predicts one number exactly, prime by

3
00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:07.100
prime. Only the rank part was known.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.610
The proof checks each prime's share on

5
00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:12.161
its own, then puts them together.

6
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.432
Claimed: exact, in rank zero or one.

7
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:18.544
Not in Lean.
